# What is uploaded to Expo when the driver app is built with EAS.
#
# EAS uploads the whole git repository, not only apps/driver. Only the app is
# needed for a build, so everything else stays here: above all docs/, which
# holds internal company IDs.
#
# When this file exists, EAS does not read the .gitignore files, so their rules
# are repeated below. Folder names are written without a trailing slash because
# EAS tests them that way.

# Top level: nothing except apps
/*
!/apps

# The git history. EAS uploads the .git folder of its clone (with the latest
# version of every file in the repository) unless it is listed here.
.git

# Never upload (same as the .gitignore files)
node_modules
.env*
!.env.example
.expo
dist
web-build
*.apk
*.aab
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.pem
*.mobileprovision
*.tsbuildinfo
.kotlin
/apps/driver/android
/apps/driver/ios
